% Quake-immune enemy; one companion taunts, the only quaker is also the only taunter.
linked(y1, y2). linked(y2, y1). linked(y1, y3). linked(y3, y1).
fragile(y2, chasm). edge(y3, void).
companion(c). companion(d).
at(c, y1). at(d, y3).
knows(c, jeer). knows(c, stomp). knows(d, kick). knows(d, stomp).
skillKind(jeer, taunt). skillKind(stomp, quake). skillKind(kick, push).
at(wisp, y1).
